  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: denial of service and limited memory disclosure in CTDB\n     via malformed packets on the CTDB private network and event socket\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-58224.patch: validate protocol field lengths\n       against the packet length when unmarshalling, bound array element\n       counts by the remaining buffer to avoid out-of-memory allocations,\n       fix string NUL-termination edge cases in ctdb_string_pull() and\n       ctdb_stringn_pull(), and restrict sock_daemon Unix domain sockets to\n       the owning user\n     - CVE-2026-58224",
